#. module: account_security
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_security/models/account_move.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"You cannot delete an journal entry after it has been validated(and received "
"a number). You can set it back to \"Draft\"state and modify its content, "
"then re-confirm it."
msgstr ""
"No se puede eliminar un asiento contable después de haberla validado (y "
"haber recibido un número). Se puede volver a ponerlo en estado \"Borrador\" "
"y modificar su contenido, y luego volver a confirmarlo."
